    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>奇物，非普通</em></p><p>这个木盒中装有一副有32张由羊皮纸制成的卡牌的牌组。</p><table data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Deck of Miscellany\" class=\"w-100 stripe-odd-table\"><caption>杂烩牌组</caption><thead><tr><th data-rd-isroller=\"true\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\">[[/r 1d32]]{扑克牌}</th><th data-rd-isroller=\"false\" class=\"ve-col-10\">卡形</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-roll-min=\"1\" data-roll-max=\"1\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 3 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">木制@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.Item.854A011A4FBD7819]{算盘 Abacus}</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"2\" data-roll-max=\"2\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 4 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">4个小瓶@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.Item.MH5WBCHbm0HdRL7p]{香水 Perfume}</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"3\" data-roll-max=\"3\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 5 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">5天份的@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.Item.AgEYwYqnQflH56TD]{口粮 Rations}</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"4\" data-roll-max=\"4\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 6 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♦</span></td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.Item.BD6D61CA6547B6DC]{铁壶 Iron Pot}</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"5\" data-roll-max=\"5\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 7 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.Item.26A1CCA4D4FC200D]{易容工具 Disguise Kit}</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"6\" data-roll-max=\"6\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 8 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">窗户（最高5尺，最宽5尺），如果你将其摆放在一个垂直表面上，且那个表面后的厚度不超过5尺，你就可以利用这个窗户看穿那个垂直表面</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"7\" data-roll-max=\"7\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 9 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.Item.lrY5i0uWVAQx258r]{镣铐 Manacles}</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"8\" data-roll-max=\"8\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\">10 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">10张@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.Item.B7ECFAA240FCEE11]{羊皮纸 Parchment}</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"9\" data-roll-max=\"9\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 3 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">3把@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.Item.78342EC246D19CE6]{匕首 Dagger}</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"10\" data-roll-max=\"10\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 4 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">4瓶@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.Item.H3MuYMhHC8ouyp2x]{灯油 Oil（扁瓶 Flask）}</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"11\" data-roll-max=\"11\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 5 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">5件丝制@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.Item.6181A4793273F992]{长袍 Robes}</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"12\" data-roll-max=\"12\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 6 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.Item.5777EBC9E403D996]{文书伪造工具 Forgery Kit}</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"13\" data-roll-max=\"13\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 7 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.Item.F567808128333146]{长棍 Quarterstaff}</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"14\" data-roll-max=\"14\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 8 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.Item.BC9960FCDA8E3435]{渔具 Fishing Tackle}</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"15\" data-roll-max=\"15\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 9 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">皮质@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.Item.EHRyPCwiS8LJafQY]{装着18GP的小包 18GP Pouch}</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"16\" data-roll-max=\"16\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\">10 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">10支@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.Item.95FAB1D8AC957844]{弩矢 Crossbow Bolt}</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"17\" data-roll-max=\"17\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 3 ♣</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">3本@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.Item.A2E2F9F6ED324AFF]{书本 Book}，其中以通用语撰写着几项随机的历史事件</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"18\" data-roll-max=\"18\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 4 ♣</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">帆布@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.Item.50144CCED45B3F99]{双人帐篷 Two-Person Tent}</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"19\" data-roll-max=\"19\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 5 ♣</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.Item.C7EB8154F262B10A]{丝绳（50尺）Silk Rope (50 ft.)}</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"20\" data-roll-max=\"20\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 6 ♣</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">2把@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.Item.FFtdwzxSShSFuysi]{撬棍 Crowbar}</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"21\" data-roll-max=\"21\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 7 ♣</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.Item.FEB60E7C8972185B]{医疗包 Healer's Kit}</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"22\" data-roll-max=\"22\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 8 ♣</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">8颗价值5gp的宝石</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"23\" data-roll-max=\"23\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 9 ♣</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.Item.0L7uaZbCxGZnpgeB]{油灯 Lamp}</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"24\" data-roll-max=\"24\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\">10 ♣</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.Item.38FAF22884C04056]{链条（10尺）Chain (10 feet)}</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"25\" data-roll-max=\"25\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 3 ♠</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">3根@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.Item.8D4EB908E928B7A5]{矛 Spear}</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"26\" data-roll-max=\"26\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 4 ♠</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.Item.lwFoWeDxKjtbjrBQ]{钢面镜 Steel Mirror}</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"27\" data-roll-max=\"27\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 5 ♠</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">15尺长的木杆</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"28\" data-roll-max=\"28\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 6 ♠</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">麻制@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.Item.FD4EAEEDEA14F1A4]{大袋子 Sack}</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"29\" data-roll-max=\"29\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 7 ♠</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">2套@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.Item.191986051F42D84B]{高档服装 Fine Clothes}</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"30\" data-roll-max=\"30\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 8 ♠</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.Item.818E7159858CB886]{铲子 Shovel}</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"31\" data-roll-max=\"31\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 9 ♠</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.Item.6007BDFC48583052]{轻锤 Light Hammer}</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"32\" data-roll-max=\"32\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\">10 ♠</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">10支@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.Item.CF71E50BD1C63428]{箭 Arrow}</td></tr></tbody></table><p>每张牌的正面都各有着一个不同物品或物品组的插图。以一个动作，你可以从牌组中选择一张卡，将其抽出并将其扔到你周围5尺范围内的空地上。当卡牌落地后，卡牌将永久转化为其正面所描绘的物品或物品组。你可以用一套修改过的现实世界牌组模拟这套牌组，如杂烩牌组表所示的那样。</p><p>This wooden box contains a set of thirty-two parchment cards.</p><table data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Deck of Miscellany\" class=\"w-100 stripe-odd-table\"><caption>Deck of Miscellany</caption><thead><tr><th data-rd-isroller=\"true\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\">[[/r 1d32]]{Card}</th><th data-rd-isroller=\"false\" class=\"ve-col-10\">Item</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-roll-min=\"1\" data-roll-max=\"1\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 3 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">Wooden @item[abacus|PHB]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"2\" data-roll-max=\"2\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 4 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">Four @item[Perfume (vial)|PHB|vials of perfume]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"3\" data-roll-max=\"3\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 5 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">5 days' worth of @item[Rations (1 day)|PHB|rations]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"4\" data-roll-max=\"4\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 6 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">@item[Iron pot|PHB]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"5\" data-roll-max=\"5\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 7 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">@item[Disguise kit|PHB]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"6\" data-roll-max=\"6\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 8 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">Window (up to 5 feet wide and 5 feet high), which you can place on a vertical surface up to 5 feet thick and which allows you to look through the surface</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"7\" data-roll-max=\"7\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 9 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">@item[Manacles|PHB]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"8\" data-roll-max=\"8\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\">10 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">Ten @item[Parchment (one sheet)|PHB|sheets of parchment]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"9\" data-roll-max=\"9\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 3 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">Three @item[dagger|PHB|daggers]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"10\" data-roll-max=\"10\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 4 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">Four @item[Oil (flask)|PHB|flasks of oil]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"11\" data-roll-max=\"11\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 5 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">Five silk @item[robes|PHB]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"12\" data-roll-max=\"12\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 6 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">@item[Forgery kit|PHB]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"13\" data-roll-max=\"13\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 7 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">@item[Quarterstaff|PHB]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"14\" data-roll-max=\"14\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 8 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">@item[Fishing tackle|PHB]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"15\" data-roll-max=\"15\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 9 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">Leather @item[pouch|PHB] containing 18 gp</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"16\" data-roll-max=\"16\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\">10 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">10 @item[crossbow bolt|PHB|crossbow bolts]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"17\" data-roll-max=\"17\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 3 ♣</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">Three @item[book|PHB|books], written in @language[Common], about random historical events</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"18\" data-roll-max=\"18\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 4 ♣</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">Canvas @item[Two-Person Tent|PHB|tent]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"19\" data-roll-max=\"19\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 5 ♣</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">@item[Silk Rope (50 feet)|PHB|50 feet of coiled silk rope]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"20\" data-roll-max=\"20\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 6 ♣</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">Two @item[crowbar|PHB|crowbars]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"21\" data-roll-max=\"21\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 7 ♣</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">@item[Healer's kit|PHB]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"22\" data-roll-max=\"22\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 8 ♣</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">Eight gems worth 5 gp each</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"23\" data-roll-max=\"23\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 9 ♣</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">@item[Lamp|PHB]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"24\" data-roll-max=\"24\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\">10 ♣</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">@item[Chain (10 feet)|PHB|10 feet of iron chain]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"25\" data-roll-max=\"25\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 3 ♠</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">Three @item[spear|PHB|spears]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"26\" data-roll-max=\"26\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 4 ♠</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">@item[Steel mirror|PHB]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"27\" data-roll-max=\"27\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 5 ♠</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">15-foot wooden pole</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"28\" data-roll-max=\"28\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 6 ♠</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">Burlap @item[sack|PHB]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"29\" data-roll-max=\"29\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 7 ♠</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">Two sets of @item[fine clothes|PHB]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"30\" data-roll-max=\"30\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 8 ♠</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">@item[Shovel|PHB]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"31\" data-roll-max=\"31\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\"> 9 ♠</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">@item[Light hammer|PHB]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"32\" data-roll-max=\"32\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\">10 ♠</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">Ten @item[arrow|PHB|arrows]</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The face of each card bears an illustration of a different item or set of items. As an action, you can draw a card of your choice from the deck and throw it to the ground in an unoccupied space within 5 feet of yourself. When the card hits the ground, the card permanently transforms into the item or set of items depicted on its face. An altered deck of real-world playing cards can simulate the deck, as shown on the <em>Deck of Miscellany</em> table.</p>",
